  "text": {
    "en": {
      "title": "Department of the Treasury: 26 references to U.S. Code sections repealed, omitted or not in the Code (27 CFR)",
      "summary": "In the CFR chapters assigned to the Department of the Treasury in 27 CFR, 26 references in 21 sections cite a U.S. Code section that release point 119-134 of the U.S. Code does not carry in force: 17 cite a repealed section; 9 cite a number the Code does not have. The release names no successor for these sections.",
      "impact": "A reader who follows these references does not reach the text the rule relies on. No effect on a decision or an amount has been established.",
      "correction": "The agency decides whether to remove or replace each reference. The U.S. Code names no successor for these sections."
    }
  },
